   30:   * IFF validator/repairer pattern (recursive size-fit walk; every FORM/chunk size must fit
   31:     its parent, siblings sum to parent end).
   32:   * A landmine catalog distinguishing genuine content vs "preference-kills" (e.g., 240-byte
   33:     stub textures at stock paths, density-zeroed datatables) vs genuine corruption.
