codex
A couple of important details are emerging: this Python reader does not validate CRCs or require a 
path sort, but the repo’s TreeFileBuilder roundtrip test shows builder output is lexicographically 
ordered. I’m going to distinguish “reader accepts” from “writer should emit” so the spec is useful 
for a writer, not just a parser clone.
