The last needed piece is the exact CRC source. The builder stores `CrcLowerString.getCrc()` and 
normalizes paths before that, while the engine lookup uses `Crc::calculate(fileName)` plus 
case-insensitive name comparison. I’m checking the normalization type only enough to cite it.
